    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/4fd066cc1987953297fcd576c5601a48.avif?t=1752211298\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br>Pre-order now to receive PAC-MAN as a playable character earlier than through normal progression.<br><br>*Players must complete &quot;My First Golf&quot; to claim the in-game bonus.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Everybody\u2019s favorite golf game series finally returns to the fairway!<br><br>Hit the green with a variety of unique characters and courses in online and offline play, and try out new game modes that will have you and your friends scrambling for another round!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 The Classic Gameplay You Love!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/b943e17758b8335ac99da9085104e431.poster.avif?t=1752211298\" width=612 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/b943e17758b8335ac99da9085104e431.webm?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/b943e17758b8335ac99da9085104e431.mp4?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The controls are as simple and intuitive as ever. Just aim and press the button 3 times at the right moment to master the perfect shot!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Hone Your Skills in Single Player Mode</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/9af4b252ab0d64e7846a4016da22a81c.poster.avif?t=1752211298\" width=626 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/9af4b252ab0d64e7846a4016da22a81c.webm?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/9af4b252ab0d64e7846a4016da22a81c.mp4?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Test the waters with Stroke Play or test your skills by aiming for the gold in over 100 tournaments implemented in Challenge mode.<br>Take your golf skills to the next level by customizing the rules to your liking by changing the weather and time of day, and face off against a colorful cast of characters!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Grab Your Friends and Hit the Green</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/3eb7f814b16ef32a278dc438e0a43b8d.poster.avif?t=1752211298\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/3eb7f814b16ef32a278dc438e0a43b8d.webm?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/3eb7f814b16ef32a278dc438e0a43b8d.mp4?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enjoy local Multiplayer Mode with up to 4 players on a single controller, or test your skills by competing online against golfers worldwide.<br>For even more excitement, try Wacky Golf - a unique twist on golf that everybody can enjoy together.<br><br>Grab your clubs and hit the green with EVERYBODY'S GOLF HOT SHOTS. Let's PAR-TEE!",
    "about_the_game": "Everybody\u2019s favorite golf game series finally returns to the fairway!<br><br>Hit the green with a variety of unique characters and courses in online and offline play, and try out new game modes that will have you and your friends scrambling for another round!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 The Classic Gameplay You Love!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/b943e17758b8335ac99da9085104e431.poster.avif?t=1752211298\" width=612 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/b943e17758b8335ac99da9085104e431.webm?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/b943e17758b8335ac99da9085104e431.mp4?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The controls are as simple and intuitive as ever. Just aim and press the button 3 times at the right moment to master the perfect shot!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Hone Your Skills in Single Player Mode</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/9af4b252ab0d64e7846a4016da22a81c.poster.avif?t=1752211298\" width=626 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/9af4b252ab0d64e7846a4016da22a81c.webm?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/9af4b252ab0d64e7846a4016da22a81c.mp4?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Test the waters with Stroke Play or test your skills by aiming for the gold in over 100 tournaments implemented in Challenge mode.<br>Take your golf skills to the next level by customizing the rules to your liking by changing the weather and time of day, and face off against a colorful cast of characters!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Grab Your Friends and Hit the Green</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/3eb7f814b16ef32a278dc438e0a43b8d.poster.avif?t=1752211298\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/3eb7f814b16ef32a278dc438e0a43b8d.webm?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730810/extras/3eb7f814b16ef32a278dc438e0a43b8d.mp4?t=1752211298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enjoy local Multiplayer Mode with up to 4 players on a single controller, or test your skills by competing online against golfers worldwide.<br>For even more excitement, try Wacky Golf - a unique twist on golf that everybody can enjoy together.<br><br>Grab your clubs and hit the green with EVERYBODY'S GOLF HOT SHOTS. Let's PAR-TEE!",
